          ],
          [
            [
              {
                "insert": "bun run lint:apps [--root <dir>] [--pass <n>] [--json] [app...]",
                "attributes": {
                  "code": true
                }
              }
            ],
            "Static checks. Pass 1 checks resolution, wiring, literals and names. Pass 2 checks the shell. Pass 3 checks the folder structure."
          ],
          [
            [
              {
                "insert": "bun run verify:apps [--root <dir>] [--pass <n>] [app...]",
                "attributes": {
                  "code": true
                }
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "insert": "Checks in a browser that the app renders from the tokens. Run mode "
